{"meta":{"id":"tt6857112","type":"movie","name":"Nosotros","imdb_id":"tt6857112","description":"Adelaide Wilson es una mujer que vuelve al hogar de su infancia en la costa junto a su marido, Gabe, y sus dos hijos, para una idílica escapada veraniega. Después de un tenso día en la playa con sus amigos, Adelaide y su familia vuelven a la casa donde están pasando las vacaciones. Cuando cae la noche, los Wilson descubren la silueta de cuatro figuras cogidas de la mano y en pie delante de la vivienda. \"Nosotros\" enfrenta a una entrañable familia estadounidense a un enemigo tan insólito como aterrador.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt6857112.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sC0b8iPUHfZdD8kseLiHw3N8gkp.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sZxa8sM1vNp31fcC7KhuuzOy0kC.png","genres":["Suspense","Terror"],"releaseInfo":"2019","released":"2019-03-14T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"120 min","imdbRating":"6.8","country":"United States of America","cast":["Lupita Nyong'o","Winston Duke","Elisabeth Moss","Tim Heidecker","Shahadi Wright Joseph","Evan Alex","Yahya Abdul-Mateen II","Anna Diop","Cali Sheldon","Noelle Sheldon","Madison Curry","Ashley McKoy","Napiera Groves","Lon Gowan","Alan Frazier","Duke Nicholson","Dustin Ybarra","Nathan Harrington","Kara Hayward","Jordan Peele","Darrel Cherney","James Cobb","Alessandro Garcia","David M Sandoval Jr."],"director":["Jordan Peele"],"writer":["Jordan Peele"],"trailers":[{"source":"nzCyY_fTowA","type":"Trailer","name":"Nosotros  - Tráiler 1 (Universal Pictures) - HD","ytId":"nzCyY_fTowA","lang":"es"},{"source":"hNCmb-4oXJA","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"hNCmb-4oXJA","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"nzCyY_fTowA","title":"Nosotros  - Tráiler 1 (Universal Pictures) - HD"},{"ytId":"hNCmb-4oXJA","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.8","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt6857112"},{"name":